  "body": "After years of enjoying this as their personal bolt hole, and investment property, the owners have made the decision to move on and are committed to a sale. This is your window.\r\n\r\nPerched in the heart of Stanley Point, this two-bedroom unit delivers something genuinely hard to find - exceptional value, sweeping views across the Waitemata Harbour and Ngataringa Bay, two brand new decks (recently replaced at considerable cost), high stud ceilings, and a layout that catches the sun from morning through to evening.\r\n\r\nThe renovation is mostly done. Move straight in or improve to add value.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this one stand apart from most comparable properties is the title structure - cross lease with no body corporate fees. That is money back in your pocket every year.\r\n\r\nStep outside and you are a short walk from Stanley Bay Wharf for a morning swim, and the newly refurbished Stanley Bay Petanque Club is just around the corner. Devonport village, with its cafes, restaurants, and the ferry to the CBD, is minutes away. It is that rare combination of genuinely peaceful and genuinely connected.\r\n\r\nThe owners are motivated and the timeline is short. Call Kurt directly to arrange a private viewing before it goes.",
